<title>CHINA: Alpha General share offer 41 times subscribed.</title>
<headline>Alpha General share offer 41 times subscribed.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Alpha General (Holdings) Ltd said on Monday its offer of 80.9 million shares at HK$1.00 each was 41 times subscribed.</p>
<p>Trading in the stock will begin on August 7.</p>
<p>The company is engaged in importing, marketing and distributing GENERAL air-conditioners, refrigerators and washing machines in Hong Kong, Macau and China.</p>
<p>--HONG KONG NEWSROOM (852) 28436441</p>
</text>
